+    {"state": "INFERENCIA", "address": "Camera.out0 -> Effect.in0; Effect 0x15fa74", "file": "libObj.so", "method": "separate static paths", "finding": "Effect might allocate a later compatible DMM pair if Live View reaches PbCap conversion, but neither reachability nor source-frame identity is proven."}
